    "description": "The Insurance Claims History Retrieval API provides a detailed list of past insurance claims submitted by policyholders. This endpoint allows authorized users to access historical data pertaining to claims, facilitating better insights and decision-making for claim management. Typical consumers of this API include insurance agents, claims adjusters, and backend systems that require claim history for processing and reporting. By employing this API, users can efficiently track and manage the claims lifecycle, ensuring a seamless insurance experience.",
